  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Francis Tedesco is an American transport executive who leads Academy Bus, the Hoboken-based passenger transport company established by his father, Frank. Working alongside his brother Mark, he has continued a family business rooted in his grandfather’s early bus operations. Academy provides charter, commuter and shuttle services across the eastern United States.",
    "html": "<p>Francis Tedesco is an American transport executive who leads Academy Bus, the Hoboken-based passenger transport company established by his father, Frank. Working alongside his brother Mark, he has continued a family business rooted in his grandfather’s early bus operations. Academy provides charter, commuter and shuttle services across the eastern United States.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 51,
